        "type": "| Omit< PartProps<\"button\">, \"id\" | \"ref\" | \"render\" | \"value\" | \"aria-labelledby\" | \"aria-describedby\" >",
        "notes": "Applied to EVERY stop, hence no `value` — the entry's own field — and no `id` **or IDREF**: one id repeated down a bar is a broken reference per stop, and one `aria-labelledby` repeated gives every stop the same name, which no dangling-IDREF check can see because the id it points at does resolve. `ref` goes because a single ref held by N stops ends up holding the last one, and `render` because the substitution is the entry's.",
